* {{a|British}} {{IPA|/ˈwɔːŋ.kɪ/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|wŏngʹkē}}, {{IPA|/ˈwɑŋ.ki/|/ˈwɔŋ.ki/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-wonky.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɒŋki|lang=en}}

